WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The Bibliography suite contains 35 checks: 7 workloads and 5 collectors.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.600
Clear the selection. Filter Bibliography, then export_bibtex.

00:07.600 --> 00:10.300
Choose benchmark and add the one visible check. Keep one worker thread.

00:10.300 --> 00:32.800
Launch the check. The isolated Julia worker measures 50 samples.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.800
The job is complete. Open Results and the saved run.

00:36.800 --> 00:39.000
Choose elapsed time and the sample distribution.

00:39.000 --> 00:65.500
The first interactive plot is being compiled and rendered.

00:65.500 --> 00:69.000
Select sample 50 with the inspection slider. Its measured duration is 6,200 ns.
